---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 21,
  title: 'Day 21',
  date: '2026-09-26',
  description: 'PŁ Integration day',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, after I ate brekfast, I went for a meeting I created yesterday,
          and with group we together come to EEIA, and senior students show us a
          few clubs and buildings, there was also a game for first-year students
          where we needed to answer questions(6), it takes 9-16 (7h), after that
          we could go drink with other students and play games, but, I didn't
          participate in this activity, so I return to dormitorium and started
          preparing sour rye soup, the cheapest posible variant, I needed to buy
          ingredients for recipe,a knive and a ladle. It also takes some time, I
          also offered at group, a badminton activity with me, I found one
          interested, but I'll see how It'll look, we were writing for a while,
          and I wrote blog, and I read book before sleep
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I don't think I need to do anthing tomorrow, thats great, I'll learn
        programing for a whole day,cook something and read book before sleep
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 3/10, I feel like I wasted this day becouse I didn't do
          anything important,but I was busy almos whole day, meybe my time
          managment is wrong
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={5} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
